      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I absolutely agree with this feature request, going to the black cat and having kids around people with connected toys links / how horny they are / how many partners they had is a bit sad to see.\n\nHowever, punished those users aren't an ideal solution as well, there is a lot of adults on this game and most people do not really care (or silently judge) but won't be shocked / go asking around what is that X or Y, but a solution to limit bio for content gating users would be nice (to their parents to setup said content gating.)\n\n(lovense, partners list, bdsm kink list, etc, i've seen it all honestly, bro is 9 going around asking wtf is pet play and age play...)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
