      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To follow up on the below message - even without directly explicit content, which probably shouldn't be allowed in a bio anyways, sexually suggestive material in a bio, or references to substance use (such as alcohol) should be kept away from minors but is perfectly acceptable in the game with the new content gating features. So, to not be able to talk about that in your bio where your bio is where you communicate your interests in this game, especially when these interests are acceptable... it seems defeating.\n\nEspecially since groups can have this content without breaking the community guidelines (which is another conversation about content gating - other feedback posts have been made), and can be seen on the profile, I think content like this needs to be able to be content gated for safety and trust.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-11-20T21:24:01.285Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Simple request, just allow us to set tags for profiles. This lets us have more freedom to mention things in our bios that we don't want children to see, even if they're not inherently NSFW content. \n\nIt would increase peace of mind and let those of us who feel uncomfortable when children enter an instance feel more safe around them.",
